---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout 
  title="Disclaimer & Legal Notice - Non-Government Entity Declaration | MahaSandhi" 
  description="Official Disclaimer for MahaSandhi (mahasandhi.in). Important notice regarding non-governmental affiliation, content accuracy, official notification verification, external links, and liability policies."
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-10 px-4 sm:px-6">
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <header class="mb-10 text-center sm:text-left border-b border-border-card pb-8">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 border border-amber-500/20">
        ⚠️ Important Legal Notice
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-text-main mb-4">
        Legal <span class="gradient-text">Disclaimer</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        Please read this Disclaimer carefully before using <strong class="text-text-main">MahaSandhi</strong> (<a href="https://mahasandhi.in" class="text-primary hover:underline font-medium">mahasandhi.in</a>). By accessing or using our portal, you accept and agree to be bound by the terms outlined below.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-4 text-xs text-text-muted/80 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <span>📅 <strong>Last Updated:</strong> July 23, 2026</span>
        <span>🌐 <strong>Domain:</strong> mahasandhi.in</span>
        <span>📧 <strong>Contact:</strong> hello@mahasandhi.in</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- CRITICAL NON-GOVERNMENT DECLARATION BOX -->
    <div class="bg-amber-500/10 border-2 border-amber-500/40 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 mb-12 shadow-md">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="text-3xl shrink-0">🏛️</div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 mb-2">
            Non-Governmental Entity Declaration (अशासकीय माहिती दालन)
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-text-main leading-relaxed mb-3">
            <strong>MahaSandhi (mahasandhi.in) is an independent, privately operated educational and news information website.</strong> We are <strong>NOT</strong> affiliated with, associated with, authorized by, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with the Maharashtra Public Service Commission (MPSC), Union Public Service Commission (UPSC), Staff Selection Commission (SSC), Government of Maharashtra, Government of India, or any other government department, ministry, or recruitment board.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-muted">
            All government job notifications, admit cards, exam timetables, cutoff marks, and answer key updates published on this website are collected from official government press releases, gazette publications, and official commission portals solely for the convenience and guidance of job seekers.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Summary Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-12">
      <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card rounded-xl p-5">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-text-main text-base mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          🔍 Verify on Official Sites
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-muted">
          Always cross-check dates, qualification criteria, fee details, and application deadlines on official government recruitment portals before submitting any form.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card rounded-xl p-5">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-text-main text-base mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          💳 100% Free Information
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-muted">
          MahaSandhi never asks candidates for money, job guarantees, or processing fees. Application fees must only be paid directly to official government commission portals.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Disclaimer Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-md sm:prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-text-muted leading-relaxed space-y-10">

      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          1. General Information Purpose Only
        </h2>
        <p>
          All information published on <strong class="text-text-main">mahasandhi.in</strong>—including recruitment notification summaries, eligibility criteria, exam patterns, syllabi, admit card download links, answer keys, study materials (such as MPSC Polity notes), and educational calculators (Age, SGPA/CGPA)—is provided in good faith for general informational, guidance, and educational purposes only.
        </p>
        <p>
          MahaSandhi makes no warranties, express or implied, regarding the completeness, accuracy, reliability, timeliness, or availability of the information contained on the website. Any action you take based on the information found on MahaSandhi is strictly at your own risk.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          2. Mandatory Verification & Accuracy Advice
        </h2>
        <p>
          Recruitment rules, vacancy counts, examination dates, reservation policies, and application fee guidelines are subject to change by the respective government authorities at any time through official corrigenda or addenda.
        </p>
        <div class="bg-black/5 dark:bg-white/5 border border-border-card rounded-xl p-5 my-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-text-main">
          <p>📌 <strong>Candidate Responsibility:</strong> Job aspirants are strongly advised to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-text-muted">
            <li>Download and thoroughly read the official PDF notification issued by the respective recruitment commission (e.g., MPSC, IBPS, SSC, RRB).</li>
            <li>Submit online applications strictly through official commission portals (e.g., <code class="text-xs bg-black/10 dark:bg-white/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">mpsc.gov.in</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-black/10 dark:bg-white/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">mpsconline.gov.in</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-black/10 dark:bg-white/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">upsc.gov.in</code>).</li>
            <li>Verify all age limits, educational qualifications, caste certificate requirements, and payment last dates independently.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          3. External Hyperlinks & Third-Party Websites
        </h2>
        <p>
          Throughout our website, you will find hyperlinks directing you to external sites, including official government portals, exam registration systems (e.g., TCS iON / DigiALM login portals), and community discussion platforms (such as Telegram or WhatsApp channels).
        </p>
        <p>
          While we strive to provide only quality, authentic links to helpful and ethical websites, we have no administrative control over the content, security, availability, or nature of these external sites. The inclusion of any link does not imply a recommendation or endorsement of the views expressed within them. External site owners may change content, URL structures, or privacy policies without prior notice.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          4. Financial & Fraud Protection Disclaimer
        </h2>
        <p>
          MahaSandhi does <strong>NOT</strong> sell job applications, provide employment guarantees, or collect recruitment fees under any circumstances.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base">
          <li>Beware of fraudulent individuals or fake websites claiming to offer government jobs in exchange for money.</li>
          <li>Never transfer money to any individual claiming to represent MahaSandhi.</li>
          <li>All legitimate application fees for government recruitments must be paid solely through official payment gateways embedded within government portals.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          5. Trademarks, Logos & Intellectual Property Notice
        </h2>
        <p>
          All government department names, recruitment board names, exam names (e.g., MPSC, UPSC, SSC, MHT-CET), logos, emblems, and trademarks referenced on <strong class="text-text-main">mahasandhi.in</strong> belong entirely to their respective copyright holders and government bodies.
        </p>
        <p>
          Their usage on this website is strictly for identification, news reporting, educational reference, and informational purposes under the principles of fair use. MahaSandhi claims no ownership or exclusive rights over official government logos or official PDF documents.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          6. Educational Tools & Calculators Disclaimer
        </h2>
        <p>
          MahaSandhi provides interactive utility tools, such as the Age Calculator and SGPA/CGPA Percentage Converter. These tools are designed to provide estimated estimations based on standard formulae (e.g., Mumbai University, Pune University, VTU, KTU CGPA formulas).
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm">
          While we maintain strict mathematical accuracy in our tools, results provided by these calculators are for reference only and must not be treated as official academic transcripts or official age eligibility certificates. Always refer to official university marksheets and government age computation rules.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 7 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          7. Limitation of Liability
        </h2>
        <p>
          In no event shall MahaSandhi, its domain owners, administrators, authors, or editorial team be held liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, special, or exemplary damages, losses, missed application deadlines, rejection of candidatures, financial losses, or inconvenience arising out of or in connection with the use of, or inability to use, the information provided on <strong class="text-text-main">mahasandhi.in</strong>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 8 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          8. Consent & Updates
        </h2>
        <p>
          By using our website, you hereby consent to our Disclaimer and agree to its terms and conditions. Should we update, amend, or make any revisions to this document, those changes will be prominently published on this page with an updated timestamp.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 9 -->
      <section class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 mt-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-main mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          9. Contact & Inquiries
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base mb-4">
          If you require any further clarification, wish to report an error in a job posting, or have any questions regarding our site's disclaimer, please contact us:
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-text-main font-medium">
          <p>📧 <strong>Email Address:</strong> <a href="mailto:hello@mahasandhi.in" class="text-primary hover:underline font-bold">hello@mahasandhi.in</a></p>
          <p>🌐 <strong>Website URL:</strong> <a href="https://mahasandhi.in" class="text-primary hover:underline font-bold">mahasandhi.in</a></p>
          <p>📬 <strong>Feedback Form:</strong> <a href="/contact-us" class="text-primary hover:underline">Submit Feedback / Report Issue</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
